---
---

<section id="fitur" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Apple-Style Seamless Feature Stories (No Boxes, No Borders, Transparent PNGs) -->
    <div class="space-y-24 sm:space-y-32 lg:space-y-40">
      <!-- Story 1: Lanjut Otomatis -->
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-resume-transparent.png"
            alt="Lanjut tilawah otomatis di Mushaf"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[300px] lg:max-w-[340px] drop-shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[34px] font-normal leading-[1.35] tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-950">Buka Mushaf, langsung lanjut</strong> dari halaman dan ayat terakhir yang Anda baca, menjadikan penanda buku kini sekadar pilihan—bukan keharusan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 2: Standar Sahih Kemenag RI -->
      <div id="kemenag" class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6 lg:order-1">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[34px] font-normal leading-[1.35] tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-950">Khat Rasm Usmani standar Kemenag RI</strong> tampil dengan teks ayat yang jernih dan panduan tajwid berwarna, memudahkan tilawah tartil yang teduh dan nyaman di mata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6 lg:order-2">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-kemenag-transparent.png"
            alt="Rasm Usmani Mushaf Standar Kemenag RI"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[380px] sm:max-w-[460px] lg:max-w-[520px] drop-shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 3: 100% Offline & Nol Iklan -->
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-offline-transparent.png"
            alt="30 Juz offline tanpa kuota dan tanpa iklan"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[380px] sm:max-w-[460px] lg:max-w-[500px] drop-shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[34px] font-normal leading-[1.35] tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-950">Akses penuh 30 juz secara offline</strong> memastikan seluruh surah tersimpan rapi di saku Anda, menghadirkan tilawah yang hening tanpa kuota internet dan tanpa secuil pun iklan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
